0 STRIDE LAB - one-motor Hoeken straight-line demonstrator
0 Name: stride-lab.ldr
0 Author: ChatGPT; mounting adapted from CrispStrobe / Brickwright contributors
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause.txt
0 // Original mounting patterns: TIDAL TRIO, Copyright (c) 2026 CrispStrobe.
0 // New assembly and Hoeken linkage: ChatGPT, 2026.
0 // Lengths AB=40 AD=80 BC=CD=CP=100 LDU. 20 LDU = 8 mm.
0 // A=(0,0), D=(80,0). B=(40,0), C=(60,-sqrt(9600)) at Reset.
0 // P=2C-B. The tip is the last hole of coupler, local (0,0,100).
0 // Crank/coupler/rocker planes z=60/80/100; all hinges are physical pins.
0 // The virtual trace in preview.html is an analytical illustration, not a !BW joint.
0 // 1. Compact rigid chassis: two long rails and four pinned crossmembers
